<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">05052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>In the Strait of Hormuz, American helicopters sank six Iranian patrol boats while Iran fired cruise missiles at the escort fleet — the first acknowledged combat since February's ceasefire.</s> <s>Hours later, Iran struck the United Arab Emirates' Fujairah oil terminal, the bypass designed to survive a Hormuz blockade.</s> <s>President Trump threatened Iran's erasure; Brent crude held above one hundred and thirteen dollars, and Eurasia Group warns America is weeks from five-dollar petrol.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Kinshasa, Congo's army has launched a fresh eastern offensive after Washington sanctioned former president Kabila for alleged ties to the M23-allied rebels.</s> <s>A December minerals deal gave the United States preferential cobalt access in exchange for security pressure on Rwanda, which arms M23 — Orion paid nine billion dollars for forty percent of Glencore's Congolese mines under that arrangement.</s> <s>Beijing, which dominates Congo's mining sector, has publicly called the right-of-first-offer clause structurally unfair.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>British nationals are now the most common slavery victims identified inside the United Kingdom, more than a fifth of the total — ahead of Eritreans and Vietnamese.</s> <s>Ten years after the Modern Slavery Act, the government's anti-slavery commissioner Eleanor Lyons names two drivers: deepening domestic poverty and trafficker recruitment via mainstream digital platforms.</s> <s>She's calling for specialist police units; the flagship law has not dented the curve.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Jakarta, ASEAN has now publicly admitted its Five-Point Consensus on Myanmar has failed, five years after the twenty twenty-one coup.</s> <s>The bloc's founding doctrine of non-interference required junta cooperation to enforce the plan — a structural contradiction that guaranteed deadlock while the Rohingya kept fleeing.</s> <s>Pressure is mounting to suspend Myanmar, sanction military-linked enterprises, or recognise the National Unity Government as the legitimate authority.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Congress has won one hundred and two of one hundred and forty seats in Kerala, ending India's last left-wing state government.</s> <s>The defeat closes a fifty-year arc that began in West Bengal in nineteen seventy-seven, when communism was a parliamentary force in three Indian states.</s> <s>The left now holds eight seats in the national parliament; an entire political tradition has slipped from governance to existential project.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Near Azam Warsak in South Waziristan, Pakistan's army intercepted an explosives-laden coach driven at a checkpoint.</s> <s>The bomber was stopped at the gate, but the blast killed a civilian and damaged a seminary, a petrol pump, and nearby homes.</s> <s>Attacks in Pakistan rose thirty-four percent last year — Islamabad has not yet diagnosed the resurgence along the Afghan border as a war.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Saudi Arabia's Public Investment Fund has closed a two billion dollar joint venture with Brazil's BRF, the parent of Sadia.</s> <s>BRF supplies halal products globally; the stake ties Saudi supply-chain control to certification influence in a market the Organisation of Islamic Cooperation values above two trillion dollars.</s> <s>It's one of the largest single halal-food deals on record, and a concrete piece of Vision twenty-thirty's bid to dominate the chain.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China is now selling electric vehicles under fifteen thousand dollars at scale, and Australian sales data confirms the sector has tipped.</s> <s>State financing and battery vertical integration — from lithium mine to finished pack — cut unit costs below any tariff-free competitor.</s> <s>South Asia and the Pacific are next; this is the first heavy-industrial sector where the West has lost without a tariff wall holding it up.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Islamabad, a Senate panel has voided the only bid for the twenty-six billion rupee Nowshera-to-Chitral highway after it came in two hundred and twenty-four percent above estimate.</s> <s>The Korean lender required use of its own contractors, structurally preventing competitive bidding on the Khyber Pakhtunkhwa road.</s> <s>A subcommittee will now audit every foreign-funded project — a rare cancellation of an awarded infrastructure contract on procurement grounds.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Depository Trust and Clearing Corporation, custodian of more than one hundred and fourteen trillion dollars in American securities, is moving stock settlement on-chain.</s> <s>Fifty firms including BlackRock shaped the platform; a July pilot precedes an October launch.</s> <s>Nasdaq and the parent of the New York Stock Exchange are building competing systems — tokenisation has crossed from crypto experiment into core market plumbing.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A study of one hundred and ninety-one patients has linked a single class of autoantibodies to both Long COVID fatigue and chronic fatigue syndrome — biological evidence the two conditions share a measurable autoimmune mechanism.</s> <s>The unedited preprint points to beta-two adrenergic receptor antibodies and heart-rate dysregulation.</s> <s>Confirmation would give millions of patients dismissed for decades as merely functional an objective diagnostic — in sha'Allah, a turning point.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Off Cape Verde, three passengers — a Dutch couple and a German — have died in a suspected hantavirus outbreak aboard a cruise ship that began its voyage in Argentina.</s> <s>The virus spreads via airborne rodent excreta, exactly what cargo and cruise vessels generate when pest control lapses.</s> <s>One hundred and fifty passengers remain aboard; Cape Verde turned the ship away, and Spain has now declined entry as well.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Japanese astronomers have detected an atmosphere around a five-hundred-kilometre Kuiper Belt body, far smaller than any object thought capable of holding one.</s> <s>The discovery came via stellar occultation, a star dimming gradually as it slipped behind the body's gas envelope.</s> <s>The Webb telescope will now determine whether cryovolcanism actively replenishes the atmosphere or whether it's a relic of an ancient impact.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nature has retracted a fifty-one-study meta-analysis that praised ChatGPT's effect on student learning and higher-order thinking.</s> <s>Researchers at Hangzhou Normal University had pooled the studies; the journal found the synthesis unsupportable, and no replacement paper exists.</s> <s>Education programmes that cited the work as evidence for classroom AI now lack peer-reviewed backing for the claim.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Suva, three Pacific Island states — Tokelau, Tuvalu and parts of Fiji — are now running ninety-percent solar-plus-storage microgrids.</s> <s>The region imports nearly all its liquid fuel; the Hormuz disruption has pushed diesel above the per-kilowatt-hour cost of solar with batteries.</s> <s>The remaining Pacific states face a deployment decision before the next fuel shock — the case is now financial, not aspirational.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Addis Ababa, an Afan Oromo creator named Boni died by suicide on April twenty-ninth after posting an explicit farewell video that's still live on Facebook days later.</s> <s>TikTok and Meta's safety classifiers do not operate in Afan Oromo, Ethiopia's most widely spoken language — every standard suicide-intervention signal failed.</s> <s>A harassment video wishing her dead also stayed online; language-resourcing gaps in trust and safety now carry a body count.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Beirut, an Iraqi member of parliament named Aliya Nasif publicly denied a fake pornographic video; a fact-check confirmed the fabrication, yet the clip stayed up past one hundred and fifty thousand views.</s> <s>Content moderation systems treat Arabic speakers as a secondary market — a pattern that mirrors the Afan Oromo case.</s> <s>UN Women reports half of Arab women don't feel safe online, and platforms have offered no remedy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Canada's Alberta has caught a voter-database leak using a canary trap.</s> <s>Elections Alberta inserts unique fake entries in each party's copy of the roll; Republican Party data turned up inside the Centurion separatist group's public lookup tool.</s> <s>Both groups have pledged compliance, but how the data moved from the party to a separatist platform remains unexplained.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>